content:
Help me find the associations.  

#### Data:
These are the extracted domain objects and their associations:
```json
{
  "domain objects": [
    {
      "name": "Architect",
      "description": "Professional who creates conceptual designs and refines building plans"
    },
    {
      "name": "Conceptual Design",
      "description": "Early design representation capturing the vision for a building"
    },
    {
      "name": "Feedback",
      "description": "Input provided to improve or adjust a design"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Manager",
      "description": "Person responsible for coordinating timelines and project activities"
    },
    {
      "name": "Project Timeline",
      "description": "Schedule outlining key design and submission deadlines"
    },
    {
      "name": "Permit",
      "description": "Authorization required from authorities for project approval"
    },
    {
      "name": "Draftsperson",
      "description": "Specialist who produces technical drawings and floor plans"
    },
    {
      "name": "Technical Draft",
      "description": "Detailed technical drawing derived from conceptual designs"
    },
    {
      "name": "Review",
      "description": "Evaluation process of design drafts for quality and accuracy"
    },
    {
      "name": "Client Relations Specialist",
      "description": "Role responsible for gathering requirements and communicating with clients"
    },
    {
      "name": "Requirement Documentation",
      "description": "Collection of a client’s needs and preferences for the project"
    },
    {
      "name": "Client",
      "description": "Person who provides requirements and approves final project designs"
    }
  ]
}
```

#### Task:
- Draw connections between objects that have an association. 
- Name the two related objects and add a description that captures the meaning of the association.
- Return the associations in json format. Here is an example for structuring the data:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "...",
      "to": "...",
      "description": "..."
    }
  ]
}
```

Here are the associations:
```json
{
  "associations": [
    {
      "from": "Architect",
      "to": "Conceptual Design",
      "description": "Architect creates the Conceptual Design"
    },
    {
      "from": "Architect",
      "to": "Review",
      "description": "Architect performs the Review of design drafts"
    },
    {
      "from": "Feedback",
      "to": "Architect",
      "description": "Feedback informs the Architect about needed design adjustments"
    },
    {
      "from": "Draftsperson",
      "to": "Conceptual Design",
      "description": "Draftsperson uses the Conceptual Design as a basis for technical work"
    },
    {
      "from": "Draftsperson",
      "to": "Technical Draft",
      "description": "Draftsperson produces the Technical Draft"
    },
    {
      "from": "Review",
      "to": "Draftsperson",
      "description": "Review guides the Draftsperson in updating drawings"
    },
    {
      "from": "Client Relations Specialist",
      "to": "Requirement Documentation",
      "description": "Client Relations Specialist creates the Requirement Documentation"
    },
    {
      "from": "Requirement Documentation",
      "to": "Architect",
      "description": "Requirement Documentation informs the Architect about client needs"
    },
    {
      "from": "Client Relations Specialist",
      "to": "Client",
      "description": "Client Relations Specialist collects requirements from the Client"
    },
    {
      "from": "Project Manager",
      "to": "Project Timeline",
      "description": "Project Manager maintains the Project Timeline"
    },
    {
      "from": "Project Timeline",
      "to": "Conceptual Design",
      "description": "Project Timeline constrains when the Conceptual Design must be completed"
    },
    {
      "from": "Project Timeline",
      "to": "Technical Draft",
      "description": "Project Timeline sets deadlines for the Technical Draft"
    },
    {
      "from": "Project Manager",
      "to": "Permit",
      "description": "Project Manager secures the Permit"
    },
    {
      "from": "Client",
      "to": "Feedback",
      "description": "Client provides Feedback on proposed designs"
    },
    {
      "from": "Client",
      "to": "Review",
      "description": "Client participates in the Review of design proposals"
    },
    {
      "from": "Feedback",
      "to": "Conceptual Design",
      "description": "Feedback influences changes to the Conceptual Design"
    },
    {
      "from": "Review",
      "to": "Technical Draft",
      "description": "Review determines updates needed in the Technical Draft"
    }
  ]
}
```
